  "response": "Based on the provided vulnerability description, I will assess the CVSS v3.1 base metric.\n\n**Metrics Assessment**\n\n* **Attack Vector (AV)**: The vulnerability allows an attacker to view another user's images without any additional execution privileges needed. Therefore, the attack vector is **L**ocal.\n* **Attack Complexity (AC)**: The vulnerability can be exploited without any user interaction or complex setup, making it relatively easy to exploit. Hence, the attack complexity is **L**ow.\n* **Privileges Required (PR)**: No additional execution privileges are needed to exploit this vulnerability, so the required privileges are **N**one.\n* **User Interaction (UI)**: User interaction is not necessary for exploitation, so the user interaction is **N**one.\n* **Scope (S)**: The scope of the vulnerability is **U**nrestricted, as it can be exploited to view any image without restrictions.\n* **Confidentiality Impact (C)**: The vulnerability leads to local information disclosure, which has a moderate impact on confidentiality. Hence, the confidentiality impact is **L**ow.\n* **Integrity Impact (I)**: There is no integrity impact from this vulnerability, as it only affects confidentiality.\n* **Availability Impact (A)**: There is no availability impact from this vulnerability.\n\n**Vector String**\n\nThe vector string will be in the format \"CVSS:3.1/AV:_/AC:_/PR:_/UI:_/S:_/C:_/I:_/A:_\". Based on the assessed metrics, the vector string will be:\n\n\"CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N\"\n\n**Base Score**\n\nUsing the CVSS v3.1 base metric formula, I calculate the base score as follows:\n\nBase Score = (Attack Vector * Attack Complexity) + (Privileges Required * User Interaction) + Confidentiality Impact + Integrity Impact + Availability Impact\n\nBase Score = (L * L) + (N * N) + L + N + N\n= 1.0 + 0.0 + 1.0 + 0.0 + 0.0\n= 2.0\n\n**Output**\n\nThe output will be in the format of a single JSON object:\n\n{\n\"attack_vector\": \"L\",\n\"attack_complexity\": \"L\",\n\"privileges_required\": \"N\",\n\"user_interaction\": \"N\",\n\"scope\": \"U\",\n\"confidentiality_impact\": \"L\",\n\"integrity_impact\": \"N\",\n\"availability_impact\": \"N\",\n\"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N\",\n\"base_score\": 2.0\n}\n\nPlease note that this assessment is based solely on the provided vulnerability description and does not take into account any external knowledge or assumptions.",
